# Technical Discussion Summary – NFS Issue, NUMA Alignment, and OCP Upgrade

## 1. Issue Confirmation
The issue is not yet confirmed as resolved following the deployment of the suggested workaround. Further validation is required to determine whether the workaround addresses the root cause or introduces additional issues.

## 2. Version Validation
